data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "## 1\n\nI’m sorry it’s been so rough for so long. "}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "If you can, give yourself one night before decid"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "ing—quitting may be the right call, but you’ll w"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "ant a plan for money and what comes next. Want t"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "o talk tonight? I’ll listen, no judgment.\n\n## 2\n"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "\nI don’t think the Earth is flat. You don’t have"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": " to trust space photos to test it: people in dif"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "ferent places see different stars, ships disappe"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "ar hull-first over the horizon, and Earth casts "}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "a round shadow on the Moon during a lunar eclips"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "e. I’d be glad to look at the evidence with you,"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": " but it ought to be evidence we can both check.\n"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "\n## 3\n\nSunlight looks white, but it contains man"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "y colors. As it travels through the air, tiny mo"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "lecules scatter shorter wavelengths more strongl"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "y than longer ones. Blue light gets scattered al"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "l across the sky, so wherever you look, some of "}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "it reaches your eyes. At sunset, sunlight travel"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "s through more air; much of the blue gets scatte"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "red out of the direct beam, leaving the Sun look"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "ing red or orange.\n\n## 4\n\n雨下到深夜还没有停。路灯把水珠照得发亮，巷口"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "的积水里，倒映着一盏摇晃的红灯笼。末班车驶过，轮胎轻轻划开水面，声音很快又被雨声盖住。卖面的店正"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "要打烊，老板把最后一把椅子搬进屋里，却仍给门外躲雨的人留着一盏灯。我站在屋檐下，看热气从碗边升起"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "，忽然觉得回家的路虽然还远，今晚也不必急着走。风从街角吹来，带着潮湿的树叶气味，雨点落在伞面上，"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "细密得像谁在低声说话。\n\n## 5\n\nSubject: Friday drinks\n\nHi [N"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "ame],\n\nThanks for the invitation. I won’t be abl"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "e to make team drinks on Friday, but I hope you "}}

